     "text": [
      "你好呀！👋 很高兴见到你！\n",
      "\n",
      "我是DeepSeek，一个由深度求索公司创造的AI助手。我可以帮你解答问题、提供建议、进行创作、分析问题等等。无论是学习、工作还是生活中的各种需求，我都乐意帮忙！\n",
      "\n",
      "有什么我可以帮你的吗？随便问，不用客气哦！😊\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "from langchain_deepseek import ChatDeepSeek\n",
    "import os\n",
    "from dotenv import load_dotenv\n",
    "load_dotenv()\n",
    "key=os.getenv(\"DEEPSEEK_API_KEY\")\n",
    "model =ChatDeepSeek(\n",
    "    model=\"deepseek-chat\",\n",
    "    temperature=0.7,\n",
    "    api_key=key\n",
    ")\n",
    "response = model.invoke(\"你好呀\")\n",
    "print(response.content)\n",
    "34"
   ]
  }
